<v Ira Glass>[资金支持名单]

00:56:59.420 --> 00:57:06.610
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia, who told me back when he hired me--
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ的管理监督由托里·马拉蒂亚（Torey Malatia）负责，他当初雇我时对我这么说——

00:57:06.610 --> 00:57:16.920
<v Man 7>You have the ability to walk around work, show up at one point, and perhaps, like, go away for a little while, and turn invisible, and then come back and listen to what they say about you.
<v Man 7>你有能力在工作中四处走动，在某个时间露面，也许离开一会儿，变隐形，然后再回来听听他们是怎么评价你的。

00:57:16.920 --> 00:57:28.010
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带着更多《此美国生活》的故事回来。

